; The repo's shared printer glue. The error framework that used to live here is
; [Err] (vendored/err_trace); see .ai/error_handling_design.md.
;
; Wrapped (default), so it is referenced as Core.Pretty.* — a shared library
; must not leak a global module into wrapped-false consumers (e.g. lib/native).
;
; err_trace's [name] and [public_name] are the same, so the cross-project
; handle below matches the module it exposes, [Err]. It is a dependency
; because [Pretty] prints [Err.Error.t] payloads -- the direction that must
; never reverse, since [Err] may not depend on Fmt.

(library
 (name core)
 (libraries err_trace fmt))
